prompt.en:
A senior engineer reviews this effect and says it has two bugs. Which pair correctly identifies them?
```js
useEffect(() => {
  fetch(`/api/user/${userId}`)
    .then(r => r.json())
    .then(data => setUser(data));
}, []);
```

